      "itemIdentifier": "ogc.sosa.properties.platform",
      "name": "SOSA Platform",
      "abstract": "A Platform is an entity that hosts other Entities, particularly Assets (including Systems such as Sensors). A Platform may itself be hosted by another Platform. Platforms are commonly physical devices, vehicles, or fixed infrastructure on which sensors are mounted.",
