    {
      "itemIdentifier": "ogc.sosa.properties.property",
      "name": "SOSA Property",
      "abstract": "An identifiable quality (property, characteristic) of a FeatureOfInterest. A Property can be associated with different Features of Interest, may be observed by a Procedure, and can be acted upon by an Actuator. ObservableProperty, ActuatableProperty, and SampledProperty are all types of Property.",
